-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- v142: LDoN gear -> elemental group / raid tier relative boost
-- (20261012_ldon_elemental_boost) - generated by
-- utils/sql/20261012_ldon_elemental_boost_generator.py - do not hand-edit
--
-- Population: loot of the 48 LDoN instance zones + takishruins(a), ldonsold=1
-- point purchases, theme-named quested items. Gear filter: wearable/weapon with
-- at least one combat stat; augs excluded (already boosted by v100), bags and
-- no-stat junk excluded. +1M/+2M tier rows are only written as 2x clones of
-- their boosted base; id >= 3M (reserved custom band) is never touched.
-- Routing: raid tier = adventure_template type=1 (assassinate) end-boss loot,
-- or gear already at ac>=30 / hp>=150 / dmg ratio>=3.0. Group tier: all else.
-- Skip: items already far beyond target (ac>=80 / hp>=500 / mana>=500 /
-- weapon ratio >=5.0) are fork-custom endgame gear and left untouched.
-- Factors - group: ac x3.5 (cap 65), hp/mana/endur x8 (cap 190), stats x4 (cap
--   60), resists x5 (cap 100), attack x4 (cap 60), dmg x1.8 capped at ratio 3.3,
--   weapon floors ac 15 / hp 100.
--         raid:  ac x1.5 (cap 75), hp/mana/endur x1.3 (cap 500), stats/resists/
--   attack x1.5, dmg x1.4 capped at ratio 3.5, weapon floors ac 20 / hp 150.
-- All caps are never-nerf: they only bind above the item's current value.
-- Enchanted/Legendary clones (+1000000/+2000000) rebased to exactly 2x the new
-- base row (flat 2x/2x system unchanged).
-- SETs are absolute (idempotent); the manifest .check sentinel still gates it.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
